{title: Ae Mere Humsafar}
{artist: Udit Narayan Alka Yagnik Qsqt}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]Ae mere[F]humsafar,
[Am]ek zara[G]intezaar
[G]Sun sadaayein[Em]de rahi hain
[C]manzil pyaar ki[Am]

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]Ab hai judaai ka[G]mausam,
[Em]do pal ka[Am]mehmaan
[Am]Kaise naa jaayega a[G]ndhera,
[Em]kyoon naa thamega[Am]toofan
[A]Kaise naa[D]milegi
[C]manzil pyaar ki[Am]

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]Pyaar ne jahan pe ra[G]kha hai
[Em]jhoomke kadam ek[Am]baar
[Am]Vahin se khula hai koi[G]rasta,
[Em]vahin se giri hai dee[Am]waar
[A]Roke kab ru[D]ki hai
[C]manzil pyaar[Am]ki
